Watch carefully the messages as they pass by.  "The
elf wields his bow.  The elf shoots an arrow.  The
arrow just misses.  The elf shoots an arrow.  You
are hit by an arrow."  Then when that same elf comes
next to you "The elf wields an elven broadsword.  The
elven broadsword welds itself to the elf's hand.  The
elf swings.  He misses".

It takes extremely carefull reading to get that the
bow is wielded then unwielded and arrows are only
shot when the bow is wielded.

